WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.421 --> 00:00:02.923
PLUS.

00:00:02.089 --> 00:00:06.293
GOOD EVENING.

00:00:03.056 --> 00:00:06.660
WELCOME TO "TUCKER CARLSON

00:00:06.426 --> 00:00:10.531
TONIGHT."

00:00:06.794 --> 00:00:12.199
DAN BONGINO AND MARK STEYN WITH

00:00:10.664 --> 00:00:16.837
US IN JUST A MOMENT.

00:00:12.332 --> 00:00:17.137
BUT FIRST, JEFF HERRON.

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:20.274
JEFF?

00:00:17.271 --> 00:00:20.674
&gt;&gt; THE SUSPECT HAS BEEN

00:00:20.407 --> 00:00:22.543
IDENTIFIED.

00:00:20.808 --> 00:00:24.478
HE'S FROM RICHMOND HILL,

00:00:22.676 --> 00:00:27.080
ONTARIO, NORTH OF TORONTO.

00:00:24.611 --> 00:00:29.183
HIS LINKEDIN ACCOUNT SAID HE'S A

00:00:27.214 --> 00:00:29.516
STUDENT AT A COLLEGE HERE IN

00:00:29.316 --> 00:00:30.651
TORONTO.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.485
LET'S TALK ABOUT THE

00:00:30.784 --> 00:00:36.156
CONFRONTATION WITH POLICE, WHEN

00:00:31.618 --> 00:00:36.490
POLICE CAUGHT UP TO THE ALLEGED

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:40.160
SUSPECT.

00:00:36.623 --> 00:00:41.662
IT APPEARED THAT HE MAY HAVE HAD

00:00:40.294 --> 00:00:44.698
A GUN POINTED AT POLICE OR CELL

00:00:41.795 --> 00:00:45.032
PHONE, THE OTHER REPORT GOING

00:00:44.832 --> 00:00:46.500
AROUND.

00:00:45.165 --> 00:00:49.770
OF COURSE IT WILL TAKE SOME TIME

00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:51.004
TO GET THAT CONFIRMATION.

00:00:49.903 --> 00:00:52.072
HE WAS EVEN SHOUTING THINGS LIKE

00:00:51.138 --> 00:00:54.174
SHOOT ME, KILL ME.

00:00:52.206 --> 00:00:55.309
THAT WILL NOW BE PART OF THE

00:00:54.308 --> 00:00:56.210
INVESTIGATION AS TO WHETHER

00:00:55.442 --> 00:00:59.479
THERE MAY HAVE BEEN MENTAL

00:00:56.343 --> 00:01:02.049
HEALTH ISSUES AT PLAY HERE.

00:00:59.613 --> 00:01:05.853
THE CANADIAN GOVERNMENT SAID

00:01:02.182 --> 00:01:07.387
THAT THE 28-YEAR-OLD IS NOT

00:01:05.986 --> 00:01:09.790
ASSOCIATED WITH ANY TERRORIST

00:01:07.521 --> 00:01:11.124
GROUP AS SUCH.

